#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/account_fiscal_position_l10n_ar_tax.py:0
msgid ""
"The SIRCIP lines, and every line of the SIRCIP fiscal position, must be "
"perceptions with the 'Padron file' webservice (fiscal position "
"%(fiscal_position)s)."
msgstr ""
"La línea SIRCIP, y toda línea de la posición fiscal SIRCIP, tiene que ser "
"una percepción con el webservice 'Archivo de padrón' (posición fiscal "
"%(fiscal_position)s)."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/res_company_jurisdiction_padron.py:0
msgid "The SIRCIP padron ZIP file must contain a single file."
msgstr "El ZIP del padrón SIRCIP tiene que tener un solo archivo."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/res_company_jurisdiction_padron.py:0
msgid ""
"The SIRCIP padron file is for period %(period)s, but it is loaded from "
"%(date)s. Load it for the month of its period."
msgstr ""
"El archivo del padrón SIRCIP es del período %(period)s, pero se carga desde "
"%(date)s. Cargarlo en el mes de su período."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/hooks.py:0
msgid ""
"The chart of accounts of %(company)s has no account for applied IIBB "
"perceptions. Set the 'SIRCIP Perception Account' in the Accounting settings."
msgstr ""
"El plan de cuentas de %(company)s no tiene cuenta de percepciones IIBB "
"aplicadas. Elegir la 'Cuenta de percepción SIRCIP' en los ajustes de "
"Contabilidad."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ar_sircip.field_res_company__l10n_ar_sircip_agent
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ar_sircip.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ar_sircip_agent
msgid ""
"The company is a SIRCIP perception agent. Saving the settings with this "
"option creates the SIRCIP taxes, account, fiscal position and settlement "
"journal, and adds the SIRCIP line to the fiscal positions with perceptions."
msgstr ""
"La compañía es agente de percepción SIRCIP. Guardar los ajustes con esta "
"opción crea los impuestos, la cuenta, la posición fiscal y el diario de "
"liquidación SIRCIP, y agrega la línea SIRCIP a las posiciones fiscales con "
"percepciones."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/account_journal.py:0
msgid ""
"The delivery province of %(move)s has no jurisdiction code, required by the "
"SIRCIP DDJJ."
msgstr ""
"La provincia de entrega de %(move)s no tiene código de jurisdicción, "
"obligatorio en la DDJJ de SIRCIP."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/account_fiscal_position.py:0
msgid ""
"This fiscal position has perceptions but not the SIRCIP line: it is added "
"when saving."
msgstr ""
"Esta posición fiscal tiene percepciones pero no la línea SIRCIP: se agrega "
"al guardar."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_ar_sircip.model_account_fiscal_position_l10n_ar_tax
msgid "account.fiscal.position.l10n_ar_tax"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_ar_sircip.model_res_company_jurisdiction_padron
msgid "res.company.jurisdiction.padron"
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/account_fiscal_position.py:0
msgid ""
"According to the SIRCIP padron, %(partner)s also has the %(state)s perception (digit 4, delivery in %(state)s), but the fiscal position %(fiscal_position)s cannot compute it.\n"
"\n"
"To continue, use a fiscal position for deliveries in %(state)s with the %(state)s perception, with the aliquot loaded manually on the contact or obtained through its webservice or padron file."
msgstr ""
"Según el padrón SIRCIP, a %(partner)s también le corresponde la percepción de %(state)s (dígito 4, entrega en %(state)s), pero la posición fiscal %(fiscal_position)s no tiene cómo calcularla.\n"
"\n"
"Para continuar, use una posición fiscal para entregas en %(state)s con la percepción de %(state)s, con la alícuota cargada manualmente en el contacto u obtenida por su webservice o archivo de padrón."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/account_fiscal_position.py:0
msgid ""
"%(fiscal_position)s perceives %(state)s but was not applied: %(reasons)s."
msgstr "%(fiscal_position)s percibe %(state)s pero no se aplicó: %(reasons)s."

#. module: l10n_ar_sircip
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ar_sircip/models/account_fiscal_position.py:0
msgid "Fix it and select the fiscal position again on the document."
msgstr "Corríjala y vuelva a elegir la posición fiscal en el documento."

